Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Levi turned cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,day into a survival drill?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,The furious man has concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:06.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Eren complains about wasted\Ntime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:07.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bro wants heroic action but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,cannot locate the bucket beside\Nhim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:10.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Levi checks a dirty strap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:11.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,and finds wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,This isn't about shiny\Nfurniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:14.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,A frayed line doesn't care
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,about freedom speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Main character energy makes\Nterrible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,replacement safety equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:20.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Armin understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:21.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Cleaning makes them inspect\Nparts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:22.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and explain their findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Levi moves the supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:25.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Find replacements.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Welcome to logistics with\Naggressive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Eren volunteers to carry\Neverything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:32.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,My guy, one mistake becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:33.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,the whole squad's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:34.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,They distribute essentials and\Ncheck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:35.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,each other's gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not flashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:38.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Neither is surviving because\Nsomebody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:39.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,checked a buckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,This doesn't guarantee safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:42.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,It removes avoidable failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:43.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Those are different claims, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:44.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Armin knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.41,0:00:45.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,The lesson is attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.93,0:00:47.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Find the boring detail before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:48.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,a crisis makes it exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:50.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Eren finally cleans properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:51.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,The bucket receives more\Ncharacter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:53.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,development than half the\Nspeeches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:54.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Levi spots one speck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:56.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Everybody freezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:58.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,They survived the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:00:59.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, their supervisor\Nhas just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:00.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,discovered overtime.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.34,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE MOP IS NOT OPTIONAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.34,0:00:09.57,Heading,,0,0,0,,EREN HAS OPINIONS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.57,0:00:13.29,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE INSPECTION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.29,0:00:19.07,Heading,,0,0,0,,GEAR DOES NOT CARE ABOUT AURA
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.07,0:00:22.88,Heading,,0,0,0,,ARMIN CONNECTS THE DOTS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.88,0:00:28.55,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE SECOND TEST
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.55,0:00:33.46,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE LOUD SOLUTION FAILS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.46,0:00:39.13,Heading,,0,0,0,,SPLIT THE LOAD
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.13,0:00:44.41,Heading,,0,0,0,,NO MAGIC INVINCIBILITY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.41,0:00:48.73,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE ACTUAL LESSON
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.73,0:00:54.24,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE BUCKET GETS ITS ARC
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.24,0:01:01.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,INSPECTION CONTINUES
